{"content": "# 『梓川風』\n<figure class=\"float-right\">\n  <img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/basic.webp?v=262c70763956737d\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/basic.webp?v=b0960e15388e2089\" width=\"1638\" height=\"1638\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1638/1638;\" alt=\"主視覺\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>基礎方塊</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n## 表情\n<div class=\"gallery\" style=\"--g-width: 200px; --g-rows: 1;\">\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/expression/confused.webp?v=140d5524e11b26ba\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/confused.webp?v=c91fc56319585334\" width=\"880\" height=\"880\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 880/880;\" alt=\"confused\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>困惑</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/expression/sad.webp?v=d838effac54771c2\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/sad.webp?v=d8a3ba80ba425754\" width=\"880\" height=\"880\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 880/880;\" alt=\"sad\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>難過</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/expression/shivering.webp?v=806a0079420f2d07\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/expression/shivering.webp?v=67c74cbca89128a7\" width=\"880\" height=\"880\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 880/880;\" alt=\"sad\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>顫抖</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n> (coc7th | OC)  \n\nTag：  \n作家、博士、偵探  \n\n經歷：  \n為了和編輯討論下一部作品而搭上了末班車，結果發生了不可思議的事情。  \n不久後為了新作品的取材而參訪了神秘的研究機構，還沒開始工作就先睡了兩小時，醒來後搜了屍體，跟著大家亂跑。  \n後來推著椅子(好像沒用)、拿了電擊槍跟大家一起面對不可名狀的怪物(伺服器成精了!?)  \n最後打敗了||~~磨死了~~||怪物，旅途就結束了。(所以我說那個取材呢？)\n<—— 現在在這\n\n## 持有物品\n<div class=\"gallery\" style=\"--g-width: 100px; --g-rows: 1;\">\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/item/flashlight.webp?v=856682adb944f111\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/item/flashlight.webp?v=d5ee900ee5ec51c1\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 256/256;\" alt=\"flashlight\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>手電筒</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/item/stun.webp?v=7b4a072ac9310616\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/item/stun.webp?v=5cb7b918ee79b5ac\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 256/256;\" alt=\"stun\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>電擊器</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n## 服裝\n<div class=\"gallery\" style=\"--g-width: 200px; --g-rows: 1; --g-ratio: 9/16\">\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/clothing/normal.webp?v=ded637e64a478b96\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/normal.webp?v=f54d11a27c11a61c\" width=\"1285\" height=\"1920\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1285/1920;\" alt=\"flashlight\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>常服</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/clothing/sailor%20fuku.webp?v=13198fdb7c4ed02d\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/sailor%20fuku.webp?v=777621f8558907d7\" width=\"1285\" height=\"1920\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1285/1920;\" alt=\"stun\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>水手服</figcaption></figure>\n  <figure><img src=\"./api/azu5atellite/palindrome/thumbnails/webp/clothing/travel.webp?v=6573dd4d3b4d2227\" data-full=\"./projects/art/01_azu5atellite/articles/01_palindrome/clothing/travel.webp?v=8bcfc9a29794a7d7\" width=\"1285\" height=\"1920\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1285/1920;\" alt=\"stun\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n  <figcaption>旅途</figcaption></figure>\n</div>"}